{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01017",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.3,
      "end_seconds": 4.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 4.84,
      "end_seconds": 8.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.37,
      "end_seconds": 17.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.31,
      "text": "Let me think, so the the thing is, I've got a cut on my finger."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 19.51,
      "end_seconds": 26.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "text": "How long has it been like this? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.71,
      "end_seconds": 36.51,
      "duration_seconds": 7.8,
      "text": "It's been ten days, I'm fairly sure. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.45,
      "end_seconds": 40.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Alright, does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.49,
      "end_seconds": 52.05,
      "duration_seconds": 9.56,
      "text": "A little bleeding goes along with it, most of the time. The little bleeding? That's been for about three months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 69.04,
      "end_seconds": 72.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "And And what about dirty blade or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.34,
      "end_seconds": 77.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I haven't had dirty blade or numbness, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.66,
      "end_seconds": 84.93,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 86.27,
      "end_seconds": 87.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.71,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.1,
      "end_seconds": 107.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.38,
      "end_seconds": 111.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "COPD, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.47,
      "end_seconds": 115.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.16,
      "end_seconds": 121.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "Yes, milk, it it gives me a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.99,
      "end_seconds": 126.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.59,
      "end_seconds": 137.62,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "It's Tiotropium inhaler, once a day. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.49,
      "end_seconds": 143.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.7,
      "end_seconds": 159.74,
      "duration_seconds": 12.04,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother. I look after my grandchildren most days. I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.57,
      "end_seconds": 164.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Let me get the readings out of the way."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.86,
      "end_seconds": 174.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.56,
      "end_seconds": 203.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.6 degrees, pressure 120 over 72. And SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.46,
      "end_seconds": 207.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.66,
      "end_seconds": 210.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.16,
      "end_seconds": 216.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "okay, time for me to examine you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.58,
      "end_seconds": 218.51,
      "duration_seconds": 0.93,
      "text": "sure thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.28,
      "end_seconds": 221.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Let me feel here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.74,
      "end_seconds": 243.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "It's a clean shallow cut, no longer bleeding, and the finger moves normally."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.09,
      "end_seconds": 258.29,
      "duration_seconds": 11.2,
      "text": "Okay, that's enough for me. So where does that leave us? My working impression is a minor clean wound that needs only dressing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 259.14,
      "end_seconds": 261.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.1,
      "end_seconds": 273.36,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's a minor clean wound that needs only dressing, and we'll watch how it goes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.57,
      "end_seconds": 301.9,
      "duration_seconds": 12.33,
      "text": "I'll close it with adhesive strips and keep it dry for two days. Book a review if it looks red or swollen. Right, that's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.88,
      "end_seconds": 306.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}